// ............................................................................ 
// Quests
// ............................................................................ 

Q_ESCAPESOCIETY_S				Escape from Society of Leopold.
Q_ESCAPESOCIETY_L				Free yourself from the clutches of the Vampire Hunters and escape to the streets of London.
Q_FINDSHIPPINGSOURCE_S			Find the source of the shipments.
Q_FINDSHIPPINGSOURCE_L			Explore London for clues about the shipments of earth from Prague.
Q_INFILTRATESETITE_S			Infiltrate Setite lair.
Q_INFILTRATESETITE_L			Infiltrate the Setite haven hidden within the theatre in East London.
Q_FINDHEART_S					Find Lucretia's Heart.
Q_FINDHEART_L					Retrieve Lucretia's Heart from the Tower Of London in East London.
Q_RETURNHEART_S					Return to Lucretia.
Q_RETURNHEART_L 		        Barter with Lucretia to learn the location of the shipments and free Lily of her Blood Bond.
Q_BOARDMAGDELENA_S		        Board the St. Magdelena.
Q_BOARDMAGDELENA_L		        Sneak aboard the cargo ship St. Magdelena in East London to gain passage to America.

